@startuml
!theme plain
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam defaultFontName SansSerif
skinparam ArrowColor #075CA3
title Reviewed delivery and response-loss recovery
actor "Demo reviewer" as user
participant "PUG API" as api
database "Plans" as plans
database "Local inbox" as inbox
user -> api : Save evidence + expected version
api -> plans : Invalidate earlier approvals
user -> api : Prepare
api -> api : Evaluate evidence and arithmetic
api -> plans : Immutable payload + digest
user -> api : Approve current plan
api -> plans : Record simulated approval
user -> api : Execute command
api -> inbox : Insert unique command ID + digest
inbox --> api : Receipt
alt normal response
 api --> user : Delivered
else injected response loss
 api --> user : Unknown - reconcile required
 user -> api : Replay same command
 api -> inbox : Look up existing command
 api --> user : Duplicate suppressed
 user -> api : Reconcile
 api -> inbox : Compare stored digest
 api --> user : Delivered; no second insertion
end
note over api,inbox
Both stores share SQLite here.
Real remote systems need durable outbox,
receipt/read-back and fault testing.
end note
@enduml
